## Local machine / SDK config — never commit (contains local filesystem paths)
local.properties

## App secrets — never commit (real Supabase/Claude/Maps/Exotel/Sanity/Razorpay/USDA keys)
secrets.properties

## Firebase project config — never commit (real API key, OAuth client IDs)
app/google-services.json

## Build outputs
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
build/
.gradle/
gradle-app.setting
captures/

## Signing — the whole keystore dir stays out of git (the .jks is the Play
## upload key; the .pem is public but kept together with it to avoid mistakes)
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore/

## IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store

## Kotlin/KSP generated
**/generated/
.kotlin/

## Local worker-sandbox Gradle/Android/Kotlin state — machine-local, never commit
.gradle-codex/
.gradle-sandbox-builds/
.gradle-local/
.gradle-project-cache/
.gradle-sandbox.init.gradle.kts
.home-codex/
.kotlin-codex/
.android-codex/

## Supabase CLI local project-link cache
supabase/.temp/
